apps.description:
An app that supports your power of choice. 

At LiraPay, we believe that freedom is for everyone. So, we're bringing over the tangible poof: a cool card backed up by powerful partners. 

What can you do with the app? 
▪️Generate a physical or a virtual card;
▪️Shop online;
▪️Pay your bills;
▪️Cover your travel insurance;
▪️Send money to your family and friends. 

What you get:
▪️The ease of getting an account in seconds, with no banking fuss;
▪️The freedom to choose a physical card, a virtual one or a gift card;
▪️Fast card delivery;
▪️E-wallet (let this be our little secret!);
▪️Free global transfers;
▪️Our expertise of over 100 years, turned digital;
▪️Integrity and full transparency;
▪️24/7 customer support;
▪️Phone number transfers;
▪️Thorough security of transactions and data encryption ensured by high-end technology.

LiraPay will become your best friend. Your digital friend. Your partner in freedom.
